   "type": "done",
   "answer": "不是。课件中“最多 1536 个线程”只是 **Fermi SM** 的例子，并非所有 GPU 的 SM 都如此。\n\n依据课件：\n- 在“Example: Executing Thread Blocks”中说明：一个 thread block 被分配到 **一个 SM**；每个 SM 最多可容纳 **8 个 blocks**；并特别指出 **“Fermi SM can take up to 1536 threads”**，例如可以是 256×6 或 512×3 等组合 [S1]。\n- 课件还说明每个 SM 内部包含 warp scheduler、shared memory、processing units 等组件，但并未给出“所有 GPU 的 SM 都最多 1536 线程”的通用结论 [S2]。\n\n因此，按当前课件只能确认：**Fermi 架构的 SM 最多可容纳 1536 个线程**；其他 GPU/架构的 SM 线程容量课件未提供，不能据此推断所有 GPU 都相同。",
   "citations": [
    {
     "document_id": "34911c46e78edc833f283f8dd678b85d6f8c92d66859e6bf6886949181d95402",
     "chunk_id": "34911c46e78edc833f283f8dd678b85d6f8c92d66859e6bf6886949181d95402-p37-1",
     "page": 37,
     "text": "GPU: Optimize Throughput of a Large Number of Simple Threads\n  Example: Executing Thread Blocks\n\n¡ A thread block is assigned to one SM\n\n   ¡ Up to 8 blocks to each SM\n\n   ¡  Fermi SM can take up to 1536 threads\n     ¡ Could be 256 * 6 blocks\n\n     ¡  Or 512 * 3 blocks, etc.\n\n\n\n   ¡  Each block is divided into 32-thread warps\n\n      ¡  Scheduling by the warp scheduler within a SM.\n\n   ¡  Single Instruction, Multiple Threads (SIMT)\n       abstraction\n\n      ¡  Threads in a wrap should execution same\n           codes/instructions.\n\n      ¡  However, thread is allowed to execute different\n          branches.",
     "preview_url": "/api/documents/34911c46e78edc833f283f8dd678b85d6f8c92d66859e6bf6886949181d95402/pages/37/preview",
     "source": "S1"
    },
